    "finalPromptText": "I'm preparing a review of The Alignment Problem (2020) by Brian Christian — it's a non-fiction book about how machine learning systems encode human values and the challenges of aligning AI with human intentions. I'd like to start by finding some background on the author and any notable reception the book received. Can you search for reviews and author profiles related to this title?",
